# SiteGPT agent rules (Cursor)

This repo ships the SiteGPT skills and plugin manifest. When working
with SiteGPT from Cursor:

- Prefer the SiteGPT CLI for direct operations: `npm install -g
  @sitegpt/cli`, then `sitegpt agent-guide` for the command map.
- Or connect the remote MCP server: https://sitegpt.ai/mcp
  (streamable HTTP, OAuth; anonymous handshake allowed).
- Skills live in skills/ (SKILL.md format). The plugin manifest is
  plugin.json at the repo root.
- Agent onboarding without an account: https://sitegpt.ai/auth.md
